~ game_start
nitya: Yippee game started!
$> StoryManager.story_progress += 1 # SagaBegins -> StartGame
=> END

~ to_new_area
# !
$> player.surprised()
$> player.move_tiles(6,0)
nitya: Whoa! What is that over there!
$> player.move_tiles(0,5)
nitya: Oh, just some video game coin.
wilhelmina: Does it do anything?
nitya: No, this is just the excuse to create a simple test for cutscenes
wilhelmina: ... I see. Let's carry on then.
$> StoryManager.story_progress += 1 # StartGame -> NewAreaFound
=> END